        {
          "id": 3238406499,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This issue was found after merge request 24289 RTITCP: Fix TCP reassembly of large RTPS data messages was fixed and we saw that there was a bounds error in the reassembled TCP packets. The same packet capture file can be checked at frames 503 and 1026 to see the reassembled packets with no errors. The code from the other merge request must be merged in order for these packets to be reassembled correctly and the correct behavior to be observed.\n[rtitcp-large-data-reassembly.pcapng](/uploads/8b9fc0cb3f26d6a1c87fddd54fa4e447/rtitcp-large-data-reassembly.pcapng)",
